      "extract": "Actions of braid groups on triangulated categories are quite widespread. They arise for instance in representation theory, for constructible sheaves on flag varieties and for coherent sheaves on Calabi-Yau varieties (cf [@RouZi] and [@SeiTho] for early occurrences). In this work, we suggest that not only the self-equivalences are important, but that the morphisms between them possess some interesting structure. Let",
